---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Welcome to My Portfolio</h1>
			
			<h2>About Me</h2>
			<p>
				I'm an MCA student specializing in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning, with a strong foundation 
				in Full-Stack Web Development. I'm passionate about building intelligent systems and scalable applications 
				that solve real-world problems through data-driven insights and innovative technology.
			</p>

			<h2>Technical Expertise</h2>
			<p>
				<strong>Languages & Frameworks:</strong> Python, Pandas, Scikit-Learn, JavaScript (ES6+), PHP, Node.js, MySQL
			</p>
			<p>
				My technical toolkit spans across machine learning, data engineering, and modern web development, enabling me 
				to deliver end-to-end solutions from data pipeline design to production-ready applications.
			</p>

			<h2>Leadership & Impact</h2>
			<p>
				As a <strong>CDPC Coordinator</strong>, I managed and filtered large-scale student recruitment databases, 
				streamlining communication for over 500 students. This experience refined my ability to handle complex data 
				at scale, optimize workflows, and lead cross-functional initiatives.
			</p>

			<h2>Key Projects</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<strong>Financial Intelligence & Transaction Analytics Pipeline:</strong> Built an end-to-end data pipeline 
					for financial datasets with K-Means clustering for user profiling and AI-powered anomaly detection models.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>QuizTrail - MCQ Web Application:</strong> Developed a full-stack platform using PHP and JavaScript 
					with MySQL backend, featuring secure authentication and real-time score tracking.
				</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>What I'm Looking For</h2>
			<p>
				I'm seeking opportunities to apply my machine learning expertise and full-stack development skills in roles 
				that challenge me to build scalable, intelligent systems. Whether it's developing predictive models, designing 
				data pipelines, or architecting web applications, I'm ready to make an impact.
			</p>

			<p>
				<a href="https://github.com">Check out my projects</a> to see how I'm solving problems with code and data science.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>